g每日一次（口服）；第1天至第12周（每日一次，随餐）。依从：每日服药日记卡记录","quote_sha256":"cf1d2d5de2765b1efa324fa527be34059981fc063051a3793092153ccd5fbca1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"第12周NT-proBNP较基线的变化百分比（中心实验室检测）","quote_sha256":"73f1d58c9639434a82b995c30b49644f472237c93b58ef677c8edfc9173e63d6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"筛选（V1）、基线（V2，第1天）、V3第2周、V4第4周、V5第8周、V6第12周（终点）与30天安全性随访","quote_sha256":"c8cb019d79850ce756f8ed6917fa3e5e3a669afe07088080b4776b32c6af2115","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_visit"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_sample_size","es_design","es_dose","es_endpoint","es_visit"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认最终随机分组数及每组精确例数，使'每组约100例'与'总样本量约240例'逻辑一致","category":"decision_pending","gap_id":"gap_sample_group_count","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"计划入组人数-组数与每组例数对应"}],"heading":"计划入组人数","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索研究，旨在探索KZ-sGC1601口服sGC刺激剂2.5mg、5mg、10mg每日一次三个剂量水平与安慰剂对照的有效性与安全性。样本量依据主要终点第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化百分比的组间差异进行估算，每组约100例；考虑15%的脱落率后，计划总入组人数约240例。受试者按随机分配进入安慰剂组或不同剂量试验组，治疗期为第1天至第12周，治疗结束后设30天安全性随访期。依从性通过每日服药日记卡记录。","rationale":"样本量、脱落率、剂量水平、治疗周期、主要终点及访视结构均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。'每组约100例'与'总样本量约240例'之间的组数对应关系存在歧义，需医学经理核实最终分组数与每组例数。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_636dc73860ce_6cf7f1b36bd3e8f5","section_number":"5.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:62ce96a4b5ab2f2777ded1d5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:254debb4f1732c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:53ffcb794b6e30","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8ef346dbad9216","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8d28b2ee22d99d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010023222_dc017a27","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"中国成年慢性心力衰竭（LVEF≤40%，NYHA II-III级）患者，标准治疗基础上症状仍持续","quote_sha256":"cb614f9642c6b11fe626282bfa427aadfd09329dd9534215de6018c0b3a653f4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索研究","quote_sha256":"39c08a5a5286b28cb5a9b165fa342ae8ee7ba16282905492b660d6c91cffd1c1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"第12周NT-proBNP较基线的变化百分比（中心实验室检测）","quote_sha256":"73f1d58c9639434a82b995c30b49644f472237c93b58ef677c8edfc9173e63d6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"KZ-sGC1601薄膜衣片：2.5mg、5mg、10mg每日一次（口服）；第1天至第12周（每日一次，随餐）。依从：每日服药日记卡记录","quote_sha256":"cf1d2d5de2765b1efa324fa527be34059981fc063051a3793092153ccd5fbca1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_dose"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_population","es_design","es_endpoint","es_dose"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究人群选择及依据","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的目标人群为中国成年慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低，HFrEF）患者，具体特征为左室射血分数不超过40%、心功能NYHA II至III级，且在标准心衰治疗基础上症状仍持续存在。年龄段限定为成人，疾病状态为中重度，经治情况为经治疗效不佳。选择该人群的依据在于：KZ-sGC1601为口服可溶性鸟苷酸环化酶刺激剂，其作用机制为通过激活sGC-cGMP通路改善心肌舒张与血管张力，理论上对射血分数降低且标准治疗未充分控制症状的慢性心衰患者具有概念验证价值。本研究为II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计，以第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化百分比为主要终点，旨在初步验证KZ-sGC1601在目标人群中的疗效信号并探索最佳剂量范围。","rationale":"目标人群定义、疾病状态、经治情况、药物机制描述、研究分期与设计类型、主要终点均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。疾病流行病学数据及既往sGC刺激剂临床证据未在本次允许来源中提供，人群选择的文献依据需医学经理补充。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究人群选择及依据）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_636dc73860ce_91db6f43edc56856","section_number":"5.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:62ce96a4b5ab2f2777ded1d5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:254debb4f1732c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:53ffcb794b6e30","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8ef346dbad9216","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8d28b2ee22d99d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010023222_dc017a27","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"年龄18-75岁；筛选期LVEF≤40%；NYHA II-III级；稳定标准心衰治疗≥4周；签署知情同意","quote_sha256":"55b7374220042281d37951c7016fad3d93d1cbb179e8727a057f6869e357ef31","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_inclusion"},{"locator":"section:独立数据监查委员会|block:339|chunk:1","quote":"在签署知情同意书后，参与者将按筛选的先后次序分别获得筛选号。符合所有入选标准而不符合任何排除标准的参与者视为合格。","quote_sha256":"f38b943cca307422fd7765eb2e64d7adb656d64e910772d0d60740503c344b87","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:254debb4f1732c","span_id":"es_screening_process"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_inclusion","es_screening_process"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[],"heading":"入选标准","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"受试者须同时满足以下全部条件方可入组：（1）年龄18至75岁（含两端）；（2）筛选期超声心动图或等效影像学检查证实左室射血分数不超过40%；（3）心功能状态为NYHA II级或III级；（4）入组前已接受稳定标准心衰治疗至少4周；（5）受试者本人或法定代理人已签署知情同意书。符合所有入选标准且不符合任何排除标准的受试者视为合格。在签署知情同意书后，受试者按筛选先后次序获得筛选编号。","rationale":"五项入选标准逐条来源于当前项目已确认研究事实中的入选标准模块。合格性判定及筛选编号分配流程参照公司共享语料中的监管共性结构。'稳定标准心衰治疗'的具体药物类别范围未在来源中逐一列举，需医学经理确认是否需明确。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（入选标准）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_636dc73860ce_c3e64b44dcac8861","section_number":"5.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:62ce96a4b5ab2f2777ded1d5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:254debb4f1732c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:53ffcb794b6e30","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8ef346dbad9216","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8d28b2ee22d99d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010023222_dc017a27","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"eGFR<30mL/min/1.73m2；收缩压<90mmHg；近6个月内心肌梗死或卒中；妊娠或哺乳期；对sGC类药物过敏","quote_sha256":"cb719c3f421e3c0a1c504cc0c3fe0a1b0f0a52de3e6f7676560fc9661e2051e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_exclusion"},{"locator":"section:独立数据监查委员会|block:339|chunk:1","quote":"在签署知情同意书后，参与者将按筛选的先后次序分别获得筛选号。符合所有入选标准而不符合任何排除标准的参与者视为合格。","quote_sha256":"f38b943cca307422fd7765eb2e64d7adb656d64e910772d0d60740503c344b87","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:254debb4f1732c","span_id":"es_screening_process"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_exclusion","es_screening_process"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[],"heading":"排除标准","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"存在以下任一情况的受试者不得入组：（1）估算肾小球滤过率低于30mL/min/1.73m²；（2）收缩压低于90mmHg；（3）筛选前6个月内发生过心肌梗死或卒中；（4）处于妊娠期或哺乳期；（5）对可溶性鸟苷酸环化酶类药物存在过敏史。上述排除标准旨在降低研究药物在肾功能严重受损、血流动力学不稳定、近期急性心血管事件及特殊生理状态下可能带来的安全性风险，同时排除对同类机制药物已知过敏的个体。符合所有入选标准且不符合任何排除标准的受试者方可视为合格并进入随机分组。","rationale":"五项排除标准逐条来源于当前项目已确认研究事实中的排除标准模块。'对sGC类药物过敏'的判定依据（既往用药史、皮试或病史记录）未在来源中说明，需医学经理确认。'妊娠或哺乳期'仅排除女性受试者，未涉及男性受试者伴侣妊娠报告或避孕要求，该实施规则需医学经理确认是否纳入。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（排除标准）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_636dc73860ce_b0b878bb1f7b2ac5","section_number":"5.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:62ce96a4b5ab2f2777ded1d5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:254debb4f1732c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:53ffcb794b6e30","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8ef346dbad9216","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8d28b2ee22d99d"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"b02d8e58f80d057640896005df75c9083f3e3e9a35bd5bbcb5fe1bb5db54bc92","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_636dc73860ce_a3ac41b7c738ed6e:full-draft:62ce96a4b5ab2f2777ded1d5","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:62ce96a4b5ab2f2777ded1d5","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:b03335af2adf362c569a95e50f5bce42edd7fe858a7a156dcf5d275f1a8e8ac8:62ce96a4b5ab2f2777ded1d5","text_sha256":"b02d8e58f80d057640896005